WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.902
Today there are two vowels. The move does not change.

2
00:00:03.352 --> 00:00:10.164
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:14.504
The word is hop.

4
00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:16.967
And now with the e at the end.

5
00:00:20.444 --> 00:00:21.421
The word is hope.

6
00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:23.474
Now the last vowel.

7
00:00:26.471 --> 00:00:27.457
The word is cub.

8
00:00:28.357 --> 00:00:30.963
Add the e at the end, and the word changes.

9
00:00:34.363 --> 00:00:35.457
The word is cube.

10
00:00:36.357 --> 00:00:40.575
With this vowel, the long sound can come out in two ways. Both are right.

11
00:00:43.527 --> 00:00:49.290
If your child says either one, the word comes. The grown-up pages at the front have a note about it.

12
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.816
Do the four pairs of job one together.

13
00:00:52.266 --> 00:00:56.628
If the e is missed, say the same words. Look at the end. Is there an e?

14
00:00:57.078 --> 00:01:00.128
For job two, press play for your child and step away.

15
00:01:00.578 --> 00:01:03.090
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
